# Layer 3: Orchestration Layer

This becomes the nervous system.

Recommended:

* [n8n](https://n8n.io?utm_source=chatgpt.com)
* [LangGraph](https://langchain-ai.github.io/langgraph?utm_source=chatgpt.com)
* [Temporal](https://temporal.io?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

### Division

**n8n**

* Integrations
* Triggers
* Business automation

**LangGraph**

* Agent reasoning
* Multi-agent systems
* State management

**Temporal**

* Mission-critical workflow reliability

---

# Layer 4: Memory Layer

Most AI deployments fail because they lack memory architecture.

Create three memory classes:

### Operational Memory

Current tasks.

Store in:

* PostgreSQL

### Knowledge Memory

Documents, SOPs, policies.

Store in:

* Vector database

Recommended:

* [Qdrant](https://qdrant.tech?utm_source=chatgpt.com)
* [Weaviate](https://weaviate.io?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

### Strategic Memory

Decisions, assumptions, lessons learned.

Store in:

* Knowledge graph
* Decision registry

Recommended:

* [Neo4j](https://neo4j.com?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

