### Recommended Build Sequence

1. Infrastructure
2. PostgreSQL + MinIO
3. Qdrant
4. Open WebUI
5. n8n
6. Model routing
7. Knowledge retrieval
8. Executive agent
9. Department agents
10. Governance and audit layer

This sequence gets you to a functioning sovereign AI operating system quickly while keeping the architecture modular, replaceable, and fully under your control as it grows.
